        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个会话等你处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld today · %lld in all": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天 %1$lld 个 · 一共 %2$lld 个"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**%@ is offline**; its sessions can’t be shown for now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**%@ 离线了**，它上面的会话暂时看不到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**%@ isn’t responding**; its sessions may be missing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**%@ 暂时没有回应**，它上面的会话可能没列全"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**%lld machines can’t be reached**; their sessions can’t be shown for now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**%lld 台机器连不上**，它们上面的会话暂时看不到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "+%lld": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "1. Run this in that machine’s terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 在那台机器的终端里运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Approve it here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 在这里批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Mac mini, a Linux server or a cloud host can each be a machine: agents you grant access use Claude Code and Codex on it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一台 Mac mini、Linux 服务器或云主机，都可以成为执行机器：你授权的 agent 在上面调用 Claude Code、Codex 干活。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A binary file": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二进制文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A grant decides which of your projects, machines and coding agents an agent can use, and for how long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权决定一个 agent 能用你的哪些项目、机器和编码 agent，用多久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A machine calling itself “%@” wants to join": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一台自称「%@」的机器想加入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A project is a directory agents can work in. Then choose in each grant which projects it can use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目是 agent 可以工作的目录。添加以后，再在每个授权里分别勾选它能用哪些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A project named “%@” is already on this machine, at %@. Choose another name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台机器上已经有叫「%1$@」的项目，在 %2$@。换个名字吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A question expires after 30 minutes if no one answers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没人回答的话，问题 30 分钟后过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A request to join appears on your trusted devices. Approve it if the code is the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的可信设备上会弹出加入请求。核对码一样就批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
