    "Agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents change the files in this directory directly, as if you ran Claude Code there; no separate branch and no change history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agent 直接在这个目录里改动，就像你自己在这里运行 Claude Code；没有单独的分支和改动记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents find projects as “machine/project” and will see the new name. Use lowercase letters, digits and -.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agent 用“机器名/项目”找到项目，改名后它们会看到新名字。只能用小写字母、数字和 -。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents find projects as “machine/project”. Once approved, add projects to it on its page and choose which grants may use them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agent 用“机器名/项目”找到项目。批准后，再在它的页面里添加项目，并在授权里勾选谁能用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
