        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一轮完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a git repository: each session gets its own branch and worktree, and your own files are left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "git 仓库：每个会话在自己的分支和 worktree 里，不碰你正在改的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grants": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分组"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Hermesh couldn’t start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 没能启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh tells you when an agent asks something or a machine or agent asks to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 agent 提问，或有机器、agent 请求连接时，Hermesh 会通知你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Archived": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏已归档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How agents work": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Idle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空闲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If no one answers by then, it decides by itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没人回答的话，到时它会自行判断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Place: Change This Folder Directly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原地：直接改这个目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In place": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原地"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In these projects it can do anything you can.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这些项目里，它能做你本人能做的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In these projects it can do anything you can. You can change or disconnect it at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这些项目里，它能做你本人能做的事。随时可以修改或断开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupt": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupt this turn?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打断这一轮？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupted “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已打断「%@」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can no longer approve anything at once, and its own machine is removed with it. The machines and agents it approved are reissued by this iPhone and keep working (needs Face ID).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它立刻不能再批准任何事，它自己的执行机器也一并移除。它批准过的机器和 agent 会改由这台 iPhone 重新签发，照常可用（需要面容 ID）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It disconnects at once and running sessions stop. To join again it has to pair again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台机器会立即断开，正在运行的会话会停止。之后需要重新配对才能加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is still one of your trusted devices. First remove it on another trusted device, under Machines; then sign out here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它现在还是你的可信设备。先在你的另一台可信设备上，到“机器”把它移除，再在这里退出登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It loses access at once; running sessions are interrupted, and the sessions themselves stay. To use it again, connect it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它会立即失去访问；正在跑的会话会被打断，会话本身保留。要再用，需要重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may have been approved elsewhere, or it expired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它可能已经在别处批准，或者过期了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It says it is: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方自报：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will approve machines, personal agents and new devices, just like this iPhone. Approve only if that device is in your hands; if it gets lost, remove it from any other device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它将和这台 iPhone 一样，能批准机器、个人 agent 和新设备。只在那台设备就在你手上时批准；丢了可以在任意另一台设备上移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its projects and coding agents stay the same. Once you confirm with Face ID, “%@” works with the new expiry and the old grant stops working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目和编码 agent 不变。用面容 ID 确认后，「%@」按新的有效期工作，旧授权立即作废。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its record and conversation are deleted for good.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话记录和对话会被永久删除，无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its record, conversation and worktree are deleted for good. The agent’s changes stay on the branch %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话记录、对话和工作区会被永久删除，无法恢复。agent 做的改动仍保留在分支 %@ 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its sessions can’t be shown for now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它上面的会话暂时看不到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its turn in progress is interrupted first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一轮还在进行，会先被打断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join your own server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加入你自己的服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep an eye on your agents from your phone: answer their questions, approve new connections, and stop them when needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在手机上照看你的 agent：回答它的提问，批准新的连接，必要时打断它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last 30 days · tokens": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "近 30 天 · tokens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
