    "Takes no new sessions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已暂停接受新会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t a connection address. It looks like relay.example.com/o_…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是连接地址。它看起来像 relay.example.com/o_…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Hermesh background service isn’t running on it: run %@ there to check": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它上面的 Hermesh 后台服务没有运行：在那台机器上运行 %@ 看看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Hermesh core isn’t answering. Quit the app and open it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 内核没有响应。请退出 App 后重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent asked: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agent 提问：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The changes are on the session’s own branch and worktree; your own files are left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改动在会话自己的分支和 worktree 里，不碰你正在改的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The changes can’t be fetched right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时取不到改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The directory itself isn’t deleted; agents can no longer start sessions there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录本身不会被删除；agent 不能再在这里开新会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The machine is off, asleep, or offline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "那台机器关机、睡眠了，或者断网了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The machine is offline; they show once it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "机器离线，连上后显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request expired. Start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求已过期，请重新开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The session stays; when %@ sends another message, it continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话还在，%@ 再发消息就会接着做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then it can no longer use your machines": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到期后不能再用你的机器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They prove the approval came from your own device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一步证明批准来自你自己的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They’ll appear once it reconnects": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连上后会自动补上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This coding agent isn’t on this machine": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台机器上没有这个编码 agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This grant is gone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个授权已经不在了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone creates an owner key in its Secure Enclave, then one of your trusted devices approves it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 会用自己的安全芯片生成一把管理密钥，再由你的一台可信设备批准它加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone doesn’t run tasks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 不会执行任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone is no longer in your Hermesh account. After signing out, you can set it up again or join your account again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 已不在你的 Hermesh 账号里。退出登录后，可以重新设置，或再次加入你的账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone is one of your trusted devices": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 已经是你的可信设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This machine is gone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台机器已经不在了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proves the approval came from your own device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一步证明批准来自你自己的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request is gone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个请求已经不在了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This turn is done. When %@ sends another message, it continues in this session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一轮做完了。%@ 再发消息时，会在这个会话里接着做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This turn was interrupted. The session stays; when %@ sends another message, it continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一轮被打断了。会话还在，%@ 再发消息就会接着做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Those aren’t the digits. Check the other device and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字不对。请看看另一台设备，再试一次。"
